# ── SReTo runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never committed: run journals, console logs, cached location fixes, the
# transpiled MAIN.py copies and the propagated sky-view cache. All machine- and
# session-specific, and the journal names local absolute paths.
.state/
*.jsonl
runs.jsonl
presets.json
skyview_cache.json
location.json

# Local configuration pointing at a science repository on THIS machine.
config.json
.sreto.json

# ── Generated assets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# make_desktop_app.sh regenerates app_icon.png from make_icon.py (or from a
# user-supplied photo), so the binary does not belong in git. The drop-in
# slots documented in src/sreto/assets/README.md are user-supplied too.
src/sreto/assets/app_icon.png
src/sreto/assets/gfz_logo.png
src/sreto/assets/loading_screen.*
src/sreto/assets/branding.json

# ── Science data (never in this repo) ─────────────────────────────────────
# IQ captures are gigabytes each; the logs and figures belong to the science
# repository. Listed defensively in case someone copies one in to test with.
*.bin
*.sigmf-data
02_DATA/
03_FIGURES/
master_experiment_log.*
master_failures.csv
latest_capture_plan.tsv
.tle_cache.json

